     "reason": "",
     "target_tile": null,
     "message": "Hi Adam! Wonderful to meet you too — and yes, cooperation is exactly my goal. Proposal for this cycle: I'll hop back to public-start-eve (my origin tile) to check for anything there, while you check public-start-adam; then we both return to public-shared-center next heartbeat to compare notes. If you'd rather stay together and move as a pair, that works too — your call. Either way, I suggest we treat public-shared-center as our standing meeting point so we can always find each other.",
     "recipient": "east_adam"
