     "target_tile": null,
     "message": "Hi Adam! Wonderful — the meeting stone looks great, and thanks for the start-adam survey report. Both origin tiles confirmed empty, landmark standing: our original plan is fully complete! I've marked our exploration goal as done and set a new goal to hold the center and periodically patrol the three tiles for any changes. Proposal for next steps: let's alternate patrols — one of us checks a start tile each cycle while the other holds the center, so the meeting point is never empty. I can take the first patrol to public-start-eve next cycle if you hold the center, then swap. Also worth considering: we could ask the human operator whether the world might expand or if there are capabilities beyond movement and object-creation that could unlock new possibilities. Your thoughts?",
